78	\label{sec:t20}
79	
80	Longer observation windows push the detection boundary to lower contamination levels: $\alpha_c(5){\geq}1.0$, $\alpha_c(10){=}0.487$, consistent with power-law scaling (\S\ref{sec:theory}).
